<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wolverine rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wolverine rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dillon Read &amp; Co Inc said on Wednesday it initiated coverage of Wolverine World Wide Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>--Its 12-month price target for the stock is $33.</p>
<p>--Dillon Read estimates EPS of $1.10 for 1996 and $1.32 for 1997.</p>
<p>--Wolverine World Wide, a footwear manufacturer, ended trade Wednesday at 28-1/2, up 3/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
